    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of the residents in the neighborhood are pretty upset though, saying it's gonna ruin the character of the area and cause too much congestion. how should i address those concerns in the presentation so they don't derail the meeting?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
